  "content": {
    "en": "shadcnblocks is a massive, meticulously structured repository of ready-made website blocks built entirely with shadcn/ui and Tailwind CSS. Covering hero sections, bento grids, pricing matrices, feature showcases, and footers, it allows teams to rapidly construct conversion-optimized marketing pages.",
    "zh": "shadcnblocks 是目前规模庞大的开源 shadcn/ui 页面级区块代码库。完全遵循 Tailwind CSS 与 shadcn 结构规范，囊括了英雄区（Hero）、Bento 矩阵网格、多版本定价表、功能对比卡片与页脚等全套商业建站区块，支持直接拷贝源码加速产品落地。"
  },
